reproducing cases still form a balanced (both-sides-non-empty) dataset'","Plan says the emitter 'writes one strict-valid candidate spec' but never states the runner preserves that spec's gold_set/scorers when it re-writes the filtered spec"],"finding":"The plan asserts every written spec passes validate_eval_spec(strict=True) and that the runner writes a spec whose reproducing cases still form a balanced dataset, but strict mode ALSO requires a non-empty gold_set and ≥1 deterministic gating scorer; the runner is described as filtering only the mined `dataset`, and the plan never states these strict-only fields are carried from the emitter's candidate spec unchanged.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f1350ff5ab352908f","impact":0.536,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach — Disposition / AC 'Every written spec returns zero errors from validate_eval_spec(spec, strict=True)'","norm_id":"n4ba636afae51a479","priority":0.2978,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A mined candidate whose scorers/gold_set are dropped or regenerated during case-filtering fails strict validation, so every criterion is withheld and nothing is ever admitted — defeating the plan's purpose."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5556,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"medium"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] State where `estimate_usd` comes from — name the pricing lookup that turns the `criteria-eval-agent`/`criteria-eval-cheap` key into the dollar figure passed to `ledger.reserve`.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5d","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["E2"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.5707,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["\"pre-flights through `ledger.reserve(estimate_usd, ledger_path=<epic ledger>, cap_usd=250.0, reserve_usd=0.0)`\"","\"The estimate key comes from the criterion's `exec` tier ... `AGENT` maps to `criteria-eval-agent`, `1-TURN`/`2-STEP` to `criteria-eval-cheap`.\"","The mapping produces a KEY; the concrete `estimate_usd` amount (or the pricing lookup that turns the key into dollars) is not stated."],"finding":"The admission run calls `ledger.reserve(estimate_usd, ...)` but the plan only defines the estimate KEY (tier → `criteria-eval-agent` / `criteria-eval-cheap`), never how that key resolves to the dollar `estimate_usd` value the reserve call requires.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f57b8ee30fcffa4e4","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach → Budget enforcement","norm_id":"neb9b49853ecf977c","priority":0.0293,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An executor wiring the pre-flight cannot compute the `estimate_usd` argument from the plan text alone and must guess or ask."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add one sentence naming the price-table function/constant that maps the estimate key to a per-criterion `estimate_usd` (e.g. the sibling ledger child's pricing lookup), so the reserve argument is fully derivable.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.1111,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capa